  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesTreasurySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsTreasurySharesEtcMember">権利内容に何ら限定の無い、当社における標準となる株式であります。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_OrdinarySharesSharesWithFullVotingRightsOtherMember">同上</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesVotingRights>
